{"id":"1ec0f95a3b27b30fdf811585bbb1056525e2edcd","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231295","title":"opencode go 似乎能用 deepseek 正式版了，但是会有一个很奇怪的报错","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yiranw09","excerpt":"程序员 - @yiranw09 - https://i.imgur.com/qrpZiE3.png 你需要在后台开启一个授权 额度和价格暂时没有变... 实测 flash 正式版跑之前 pro 的任务一点问题也没有，而且要","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/qrpZiE3.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qrpZiE3.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br> 你需要在后台开启一个授权<br> 额度和价格暂时没有变...<br> 实测 flash 正式版跑之前 pro 的任务一点问题也没有，而且要快太多太多了<br> 假如 flash 真如跑分测试那样超过 glm5.2...<br> 10 刀一个月的 opencode go 就太香了，可以说怎么都用不完了</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925790\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/780f/3cc6/627042_normal.png?m=1785488079\" alt=\"yiranw09\" data-uid=\"627042\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yiranw09\">yiranw09</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:38:26 +08:00\">23h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>太快了...真的是太快了<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/eyyvp2A.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eyyvp2A.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>现在叫 flash （ new ），相比预览版 pro 差别不大的能力，但是快了好几倍速度<br>以及...超级低的价格和 go 套餐惊人的 flash 用量</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926070\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6cfd2a37f6a87929944a1bfefc6c97f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lscho\" data-uid=\"294493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lscho\">lscho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 19:52:03 +08:00\">20h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opencode go 不减少 flash 的用量，那简直太香了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926365\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5f76/7779/76329_normal.png?m=1711676102\" alt=\"xiaoz\" data-uid=\"76329\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaoz\">xiaoz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 23:29:44 +08:00\">17h 18m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yiranw09\">yiranw09</a> 应该是用了 ds 公开的 dspark 技术来加速。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926376\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ace/a258/379443_normal.png?m=1728373625\" alt=\"www12222\" data-uid=\"379443\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/www12222\">www12222</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 23:36:43 +08:00\">17h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ds 我接入 pi 真有点 glm5.2 的感觉 做点重复度高的活真的挺快挺爽的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926380\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <t